# Agent-local config and OpenSpec's `openspec init --tools claude` scaffolding.
# The committed OpenSpec change lives under openspec/; the .claude/ tooling is
# per-developer and must never ship in the CLI package.
# Exception: .claude/skills/ holds committed project-level deep-dive skills that
# AGENTS.md points to, so those DO ship in the repo (but not the CLI package).
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/